      "problem": "Compute the gradient of the function $f:{R}^{4}\\to R$ defined by \n\n$$\nf(x)=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 & -4\\end{aligned}]\\cdot x\n$$\n\n with respect to $x$ at $x=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].$",
